UPDATE product SET metadata = '{"Key Features":"• 25-bar espresso extraction for rich, full-flavoured espresso\n• Hot or cold water brewing for flexible use\n• Up to 100 espresso shots per charge\n• 9600 mAh rechargeable battery for dependable performance\n• USB-C fast charging for convenient recharging\n• Single-button operation for simple, effortless brewing\n• Compact, durable design built for travel and daily use\n• Water-resistant carry case included","Compatibility":"\nBrew the way you prefer.&nbsp;<div></div><div>pomabru is built for flexibility, allowing you to enjoy espresso in the format that suits your routine best.</div><div>Compatible with:&nbsp;</div><div>• Nespresso®-style pods&nbsp;</div><div>• Dolce Gusto®-style pods&nbsp;</div><div>• Ground coffee&nbsp;</div><div><span></span></div><div><span>This gives you the freedom to choose convenience, variety, or a more traditional coffee experience, wherever you are.</span></div>","Battery & Charging":"<div class=\"accordion__content prose\"><p><span>Built for portability and convenience.</span></p><p><span>poma</span><span>bru is powered by a high-capacity</span><span> </span><span>9600 mAh rechargeable battery</span><span>, designed to support repeated use between charges.</span></p><ul><li><span>Up to 100 espresso shots per charge</span></li><li><span>Fast USB-C charging</span></li><li>Fully recharges in approximately <span>3 hours </span>when using a fast-charging adapter.</li><li>Can also be used to<span> </span><span>charge small devices</span><span> </span><span>via USB-C output while on the go.</span></li></ul><p>For optimal fast-charging performance, use a charging adapter rated at 30W or higher. The <span>poma</span>bru includes a charging cable only; power adapter not included.</p><p><span>Whether youre travelling, commuting, or spending time outdoors,</span><span> </span><span>poma</span><span>bru is designed to keep up with your routine.</span></p></div>","Shipping & Delivery":"Free standard global shipping on orders over £50.","Whats inside the box":"\nEverything you need to get started.\n\nYour pomabru includes:\n\n• pomabru portable espresso machine: A compact, rechargeable espresso maker designed for life on the move.\n• Ground coffee scoop: Helps measure the ideal amount of coffee for a consistent espresso.\n• Water-resistant carry case: Keeps your pomabru protected and travel-ready.\n• USB-C charging cable: For convenient, reliable charging."}' WHERE handle LIKE '%pomabru%';
